{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Visto 是一款注重私隱、可離線使用的觀影記錄工具，適合想逐集追蹤電視節目、一鍵記錄電影並保留完整觀影歷史的使用者。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-1.webp\">\n<h2>逐集追蹤與離線記錄</h2>\n<p>Visto 支援逐集及逐季勾選電視節目，電影可一鍵記錄，並可加入重看、1 至 10 分評分與短評，保留準確日期和次數。書架分為待看清單、觀影歷史及追蹤節目，進度精確；統計以實際集數、電影數與觀看時間呈現。資料儲存於裝置並可完全離線使用，亦可使用自己的 iCloud 備份，無需帳號、登入或追蹤，內建 JSON 匯入與匯出。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-73-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-74-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-75-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-76-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-77-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-78-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Visto: TV Show &amp; Movie Tracker</li>\n<li>應用類別：Entertainment</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:06.967189+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":320,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T22:27:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T18:57:48.205771+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:58:15.688142+00:00","content_hash":"b9d955eb29af9962c7cf337bd9824d9fc50190bf349ad0dad1021b8144b7fdb4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}